---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - SolveSteps" description="Privacy policy for SolveSteps. We don't collect, track, or store any of your personal data.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8">Last updated: January 2024</p>

    <div class="prose prose-sm max-w-none text-gray-700 space-y-6">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Overview</h2>
        <p>
          SolveSteps is committed to protecting your privacy. We want to be completely transparent about how our tools work: <strong>we don't collect, track, or store any personal data.</strong>
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">What We Don't Do</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-gray-700">
          <li>We don't collect any information about you</li>
          <li>We don't track your behavior or activity</li>
          <li>We don't store your plans, checklists, or routines on our servers</li>
          <li>We don't use cookies to track you across the web</li>
          <li>We don't sell or share your data with third parties</li>
          <li>We don't display targeted ads based on your data</li>
          <li>We don't require an account or login</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">How Your Data Works</h2>
        <p>
          When you use SolveSteps tools (checklist, planner, routine builder), your data is stored locally on your device using your browser's local storage. This means:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-gray-700">
          <li>Your data is only visible to you</li>
          <li>Your data persists if you close and reopen the browser</li>
          <li>If you clear your browser's cache/storage, your data will be deleted</li>
          <li>Your data is never sent to our servers</li>
          <li>If you switch devices or browsers, your data won't be available (because it's not synced)</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
          SolveSteps is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may collect information about your visit (such as your IP address and the time you visited) for the purpose of operating and improving the service. This is normal for any website. For more information, see <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline">Cloudflare's Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          We do not use analytics tools, trackers, or third-party advertising services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Contact Form</h2>
        <p>
          If you use the contact form on our website to send feedback, your email address and message are sent directly to us via email service. We will only use this information to respond to your inquiry and improve our service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          SolveSteps does not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If we become aware that we have collected personal information from a child under 13, we will take steps to delete such information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this privacy policy from time to time. We will notify you of any significant changes by updating the date at the top of this page.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about this privacy policy, please contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@solvesteps.io" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 underline">hello@solvesteps.io</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-lg mt-8">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">In Plain English</h3>
        <p>
          We don't collect your personal information. You own your data completely. Everything you create in SolveSteps stays on your device. That's it.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>